*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*                       SIMULATION PARAMETERS
*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*1  ---- Ensemble control variables
* NVE (microcanonical) NVT (canonical) NPT (isothermal-isobaric) Anisotropic
  .false.               .true.         .false.                   .false.
*
*2  ----  Dispersive interaction and integration control
* Cutoff Radius    Max"Drift"     Delta(fs)   Number of steps
 12.0             1.0            0.5         200
*
*3  ---- Thermostat
* Temperature (K)  Num_NHC  OmegaQ (1/fs)
 296.15           1        0.01
*
*4  ---- Barostat
*Pressure Setpoint (atm) Allow Box Rescaling? Average Pressure?  OmegaW(1/fs)
*    X      Y      Z         X    Y    Z          X   Y   Z
    1.0    1.0    1.0        T    T    T          T   T   T         0.0005
*
*XXX ---- Static Polarization Model [No Longer Used - Do Not Change (DNC) ]
* Do Not Change  Do Not Change  Do Not Change  Do Not Change   Do Not Change
 .false.         13.0           14.5           50.0            4.5
*
*5  ---- Statistic collection and output control
* Initialize(fs)  Average(fs)  Pressure(fs)  Energy Split(fs)  Coord Output(fs)
  30.0             150.0         150.0         1000000           1
*
*------- Trajectory file settings
*6  ----   Trajectory Output Flags (Filenames: fort.XX)
* BoxDipole(76)   Coordinates(77)   Stress Tensor(78)   Velocities(79)
 .false.           .TRUE.            .false.              .false.
*7  ----   Trajectory Output Frequency (femtoseconds)
* Dipole Time      Coordinate Time   Stress Time        Velocity Time
  100              1              3                  1500
*
*7  ---- System Adjustment and Debugging
* Resize Box?      Target Box Size   Output Additional Information?
  .false.          50.00  50.00  50.00    .false.
*
*8  ----  Interaction control
* Calc Intermolecular?   Exclude 1-4?      Isokinetic Ensemble?
  .TRUE.                 .false.           .true.
*
*9  ----  1-4 Interaction Scaling
* Reduce 1-4(Exc. mu-mu)  Reduce 1-4 Factor  Reduce Q-mu 1-4  Red. Q-mu Factor
  .false.                 0.0                .TRUE.           0.8
*
*10 ----  Bond constraints (SHAKE Algorithm)
* Constrain Bonds?     Tolerance (SHAKE)
  .TRUE.                  1.e-4
*
*11 ----  Long range electrostatic calculation (Ewald Sum)
* Electrostatic Calculation Type      Alpha      Maximum K Vector  Enable
  Ewald                               0.23       7   7   7         .TRUE.
*
*12 ----  Integrator control
* Integrator Type     Medium Steps   Large Steps   Small Timestep Cutoff
  Multiple3           1              1               8
*
*13 ----  Many body polarization control
* Q-mu    mu-mu     |  Polarization Tol.  Tapering   Taper Start  Epsilon(RF)
  Ewald   RF/Taper  |  1.0e-4             .TRUE.     14.5          1.0
